# Local environment and caches -- never committed from anywhere in this tree.
.venv/
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# ONLY THE NOTEBOOKS AND WHAT THEY PRODUCE ARE TRACKED (owner decision, 2026-10-20).
#
# Everything else here is working material: `rl_core/` and `tests/` are the library the notebooks
# import, and the manifest, requirements and runner are local scaffolding. The notebooks and their
# outputs/ are the deliverable -- the figures, models and reports a reader needs to follow the
# work without running it.
#
# The pattern is deny-then-allow, which is the only way to express "nothing except": a bare
# `rl_core/` line would have to be extended by hand every time a new directory appears here, and
# the thing that gets forgotten is exactly the thing that should not be published.
/*
!.gitignore
!notebooks/
notebooks/*
!notebooks/*.ipynb
!notebooks/outputs/

# NB05 is excluded by name (owner decision): it exports a training DATASET, which is working
# material rather than part of the written-up result.
notebooks/NB05_training_dataset_export.ipynb
